<title>USA: Old Kent Financial Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Old Kent Financial Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>OLD KENT FINANCIAL CORPORATION</p>
<p>									 Percent</p>
<p> EARNINGS SUMMARY:		    1996	   1995(a)  Change</p>
<p>Quarter ended Sept. 30:</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share:	     $0.87	     $0.80   8.8%</p>
<p> Net Income		     40,297,000	38,316,000   5.2%</p>
<p>Nine months ended Sept. 30:</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		$2.48	     $2.30   7.8%</p>
<p> Net Income		    117,092,000     110,412,000   6.1%</p>
<p>Balance Sheet Data at</p>
<p>September 30:</p>
<p> Loans			 8,035,627,000   7,155,662,000  12.3%</p>
<p> Securities		  3,027,434,000   3,305,066,000 (8.4%)</p>
<p>Total Interest-earning</p>
<p>   Assets		   11,480,857,000  10,925,337,000   5.1%</p>
<p> Core Deposits	     8,799,676,000   8,028,186,000   9.6%</p>
<p> Total Deposits	    9,975,429,000   9,342,896,000   6.8%</p>
<p> Total Assets	     12,466,573,000  11,796,134,000   5.7%</p>
<p> Shareholders' Equity	988,349,000     999,237,000 (1.1%)</p>
<p>(a)  Adjusted to reflect a 5 percent stock dividend paid July 25, 1996, to shareholders of record on June 25, 1996.</p>
